SPACIOUS 3-BEDROOM APARTMENT IN QUEIJAS | 107 SQ M |
BALCONIES | ABUNDANT NATURAL LIGHT | FREE PARKING 

A spacious and bright home with excellent potential in a well-established residential area 

Located in Queijas, on Rua Afonso Lopes Vieira, this spacious 3-bedroom apartment offers an excellent combination of generous living space, abundant natural light, outdoor areas and a highly convenient location.&nbsp;

With 107 sq m of private gross area, the property is situated on the second floor of a building without a lift, with easy-to-use, comfortable stairs.&nbsp;

One of the apartment's most attractive features is its exceptional natural light and sunlight, together with balconies surrounding several areas of the property, creating a bright and welcoming atmosphere throughout the day.&nbsp;

A spacious and functional layout 

The apartment comprises: &nbsp;

Three bedrooms, two with direct access to balconies and one with a window;&nbsp;

One bedroom with built-in wardrobe;&nbsp;

A spacious living room with balcony access;&nbsp;

A kitchen with enclosed balcony/utility area, already renovated;&nbsp;

Two bathrooms, both with windows;&nbsp;

A generous entrance hall with a pantry/storage area;&nbsp;

Several balconies offering additional outdoor space and plenty of natural light.&nbsp;

The apartment retains its original character and finishes in most areas, while the kitchen has already been renovated.&nbsp;

The property would benefit from modernisation, offering an excellent opportunity for a new owner to create a contemporary home tailored to their own taste and lifestyle.&nbsp;

A property with considerable potential 

The generous floor area, natural light and outdoor spaces provide an excellent foundation for a renovation project.&nbsp;

Whether you are looking for a family home, a property to modernise and make your own, or an investment opportunity, this apartment offers considerable potential.&nbsp;

Convenient location in Queijas 

The location is one of the property's strongest advantages.&nbsp;

Queijas is a well-established residential area offering a wide range of local shops, supermarkets, schools, services and everyday amenities.&nbsp;

A Pingo Doce supermarket is practically on the doorstep, making everyday shopping particularly convenient.&nbsp;

The property also benefits from plenty of free public parking immediately outside the building, an increasingly valuable feature in the Lisbon metropolitan area.&nbsp;

An opportunity to create your ideal home 

With its 107 sq m of space, excellent natural light, balconies, two windowed bathrooms and highly convenient location, this apartment offers a rare combination of features and significant potential for transformation.&nbsp;

It is equally suitable for those looking for a permanent family home or for buyers considering a property with investment and rental potential.&nbsp;

Come and discover the space, light and potential of this property for yourself.&nbsp;

 Contact me to arrange a private viewing.

I will be delighted to welcome you and show you around the property.&nbsp;

